1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 15=

10
00:01:03,580 --> 00:01:06,630
The true mastermind behind
the massacre of the Shen family

11
00:01:07,100 --> 00:01:09,310
was the master who once saved your life,

12
00:01:09,580 --> 00:01:10,990
Xie Yungui.

13
00:01:14,750 --> 00:01:16,020
With death staring you in the face,

14
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:18,110
you still dare falsely accuse my master.

15
00:01:21,750 --> 00:01:23,150
Your master, Xie Yungui,

16
00:01:23,150 --> 00:01:24,790
was born Xiao Jue.

17
00:01:26,110 --> 00:01:29,260
He and Great General Jingyuan Xiao Jing

18
00:01:29,260 --> 00:01:31,260
are half brothers with the same father.

19
00:01:31,900 --> 00:01:33,430
Xiao Jing wanted
to create poison soldiers

20
00:01:33,430 --> 00:01:35,450
using the epidemic poison chapter
of The Forbidden Qingnang Formulas.

21
00:01:35,830 --> 00:01:38,540
So Xiao Jue assumed a new identity

22
00:01:38,620 --> 00:01:39,710
and lay low in the Capital,

23
00:01:39,750 --> 00:01:40,750
where he approached Shen Ji

24
00:01:40,860 --> 00:01:42,940
all to obtain
the epidemic poison chapter.

25
00:01:43,790 --> 00:01:47,790
You will all suffer
the consequences of your deeds.

26
00:01:54,260 --> 00:01:56,390
Why do you think
he saved you that night?

27
00:01:56,710 --> 00:01:58,830
He only wanted to keep you by his side

28
00:01:58,940 --> 00:02:01,230
so he could learn
where the epidemic poison chapter was.

29
00:02:01,620 --> 00:02:02,470
And you

30
00:02:04,540 --> 00:02:09,030
were nothing more
than a pawn in his hands.

31
00:02:11,110 --> 00:02:11,780
I don't believe

32
00:02:13,110 --> 00:02:14,420
a single word you say.

33
00:02:16,830 --> 00:02:19,230
Why would a dying man bother to lie?

34
00:02:20,830 --> 00:02:23,180
Shen Li, what revenge
have you really taken?

35
00:02:23,670 --> 00:02:26,670
You merely killed
a few lackeys with your own hands,

36
00:02:27,470 --> 00:02:28,830
while the true culprit

37
00:02:31,420 --> 00:02:33,540
was the man you called Master
for all these years.

38
00:02:34,260 --> 00:02:36,180
What a cruel joke.

39
00:02:36,510 --> 00:02:37,180
Shut up!

40
00:02:42,540 --> 00:02:44,110
What a joke.

41
00:02:58,420 --> 00:02:59,340
You've improved greatly.

42
00:03:00,230 --> 00:03:01,670
Your strikes are now steady,
precise, and ruthless.

43
00:03:02,340 --> 00:03:02,950
However,

44
00:03:03,780 --> 00:03:06,190
blades and arrows
are not the only ways to kill.

45
00:03:07,230 --> 00:03:08,390
Words can kill,

46
00:03:08,700 --> 00:03:10,790
and schemes can destroy the heart.

47
00:03:11,510 --> 00:03:13,860
Now that you've mastered both
the healing arts and the art of strategy,

48
00:03:14,630 --> 00:03:15,540
let me ask you this.

49
00:03:17,790 --> 00:03:18,790
Who are you?

50
00:03:20,910 --> 00:03:22,110
I am a blade forged for vengeance.

51
00:03:23,110 --> 00:03:24,190
The day I am drawn

52
00:03:24,740 --> 00:03:27,350
will be the day Cui Hong, Zhao Wujiu,

53
00:03:27,690 --> 00:03:29,450
and the one bearing the man-eating flower
mark are destroyed.

54
00:03:29,610 --> 00:03:31,700
♪If Heaven truly has eyes♪

55
00:03:31,790 --> 00:03:35,230
The Shen family's
blood still cries out for justice.

56
00:03:37,350 --> 00:03:41,260
For years, Shen Li
gave her trust to the wrong man.

57
00:03:42,260 --> 00:03:46,350
Only through vengeance
did she finally see the truth.

58
00:03:47,390 --> 00:03:52,420
The master she revered
was the one who slaughtered her family.

59
00:03:52,420 --> 00:03:55,220
(Shen Li Turns Against Her Master)

60
00:04:18,540 --> 00:04:19,110
My dear,

61
00:04:22,670 --> 00:04:23,790
what are you doing here?

62
00:04:26,460 --> 00:04:27,110
General.

63
00:04:27,830 --> 00:04:30,580
I... I heard something in here just now

64
00:04:31,420 --> 00:04:33,230
and thought an enemy spy had slipped in,

65
00:04:33,860 --> 00:04:35,260
so I quietly came in to investigate.

66
00:04:36,260 --> 00:04:37,230
It gave me quite a fright.

67
00:04:39,580 --> 00:04:42,190
And did you find anything?

68
00:04:44,300 --> 00:04:44,830
No.

69
00:04:46,260 --> 00:04:48,860
I was simply
too worried about you, General,

70
00:04:49,260 --> 00:04:50,910
so I let my imagination run wild.

71
00:04:52,020 --> 00:04:53,390
There was no enemy spy.

72
00:04:54,540 --> 00:04:57,790
I was merely worrying too much.

73
00:04:58,580 --> 00:05:00,350
It is my fault

74
00:05:01,420 --> 00:05:02,390
for making you worry about me.

75
00:05:10,070 --> 00:05:10,700
Tonight,

76
00:05:12,070 --> 00:05:13,780
I will personally lead
the poison soldiers into battle.

77
00:05:17,700 --> 00:05:19,190
You may come with me

78
00:05:20,550 --> 00:05:23,990
and witness your husband's
triumph with your own eyes.

79
00:05:38,390 --> 00:05:38,990
Li.

80
00:05:40,900 --> 00:05:41,830
You're back.

81
00:05:50,660 --> 00:05:52,460
The night the Shen family was massacred,

82
00:05:55,550 --> 00:05:57,550
how did you happen
to appear and save me?

83
00:06:04,310 --> 00:06:05,700
Was it really just a coincidence?

84
00:06:16,070 --> 00:06:17,310
You took me as your apprentice

85
00:06:17,950 --> 00:06:19,100
and taught me everything you knew,

86
00:06:20,020 --> 00:06:21,190
all to gain my trust

87
00:06:23,630 --> 00:06:25,140
so you could use my identity

88
00:06:26,780 --> 00:06:27,900
to find that medical book.

89
00:06:31,830 --> 00:06:32,780
You saved me

90
00:06:34,550 --> 00:06:36,100
and set this entire scheme in motion,

91
00:06:37,220 --> 00:06:37,950
using me as your blade

92
00:06:37,950 --> 00:06:38,950
to kill so many people,

93
00:06:42,580 --> 00:06:44,190
all for your brother,

94
00:06:45,700 --> 00:06:46,950
to clear every obstacle from his path

95
00:06:48,650 --> 00:06:49,800
and help him create the poison soldiers.

96
00:06:55,660 --> 00:06:56,630
That scar on your hand,

97
00:06:58,650 --> 00:07:00,560
why have you concealed it
with a secret medicine all these years?

98
00:07:01,780 --> 00:07:02,580
Were you afraid...

99
00:07:03,580 --> 00:07:07,700
Were you afraid I'd see this mark?

100
00:07:10,750 --> 00:07:12,430
So from the very beginning,

101
00:07:12,990 --> 00:07:14,430
you were the one hiding in the shadows,

102
00:07:16,100 --> 00:07:18,580
the mastermind controlling everything.

103
00:07:21,830 --> 00:07:24,950
The true culprit behind the deaths
of all 37 members of my Shen family

104
00:07:25,020 --> 00:07:26,140
was you.

105
00:07:29,780 --> 00:07:31,070
If I kill you today,

106
00:07:32,390 --> 00:07:33,990
will you have
a single word of resentment?

107
00:07:35,220 --> 00:07:36,460
Xiao Jue!

108
00:07:43,950 --> 00:07:44,950
Li.

109
00:07:47,510 --> 00:07:48,140
This needle,

110
00:07:50,140 --> 00:07:53,460
its force, its placement,

111
00:07:54,990 --> 00:07:56,190
even the dose of poison...

112
00:07:59,660 --> 00:08:01,070
How many years did I spend teaching you?

113
00:08:07,550 --> 00:08:08,340
Drive it in.

114
00:08:11,100 --> 00:08:12,140
Pierce straight through.

115
00:08:18,430 --> 00:08:20,660
Only then will my years
of teaching not have been in vain.

116
00:08:24,950 --> 00:08:25,660
Die?

117
00:08:26,580 --> 00:08:27,460
Not a chance.

118
00:08:29,190 --> 00:08:30,780
Death would be too easy for you.

119
00:08:30,990 --> 00:08:31,990
I want you to live,

120
00:08:32,660 --> 00:08:34,140
fully aware of what you've done,

121
00:08:34,900 --> 00:08:36,070
and spend every waking moment

122
00:08:36,700 --> 00:08:39,260
atoning for the 37 lives
of my Shen family.

123
00:08:40,580 --> 00:08:41,550
Li.

124
00:08:45,750 --> 00:08:46,700
In the end,

125
00:08:51,780 --> 00:08:53,070
you still failed
to complete your training.

126
00:09:24,070 --> 00:09:25,390
What a joke.

127
00:09:27,140 --> 00:09:31,070
The Shen family's
blood still cries out for justice.

128
00:09:32,790 --> 00:09:36,700
For years, Shen Li
gave her trust to the wrong man.

129
00:09:37,790 --> 00:09:41,340
Only through vengeance
did she finally see the truth.

130
00:09:42,830 --> 00:09:47,860
The master she revered
was the one who slaughtered her family.

131
00:09:47,860 --> 00:09:48,980
(Shen Li Turns Against Her Master)

132
00:09:48,980 --> 00:09:49,700
Father.

133
00:09:51,430 --> 00:09:53,190
What should I do now?

134
00:10:29,150 --> 00:10:30,860
The Noble Consort

135
00:10:31,910 --> 00:10:34,380
won't even come to see her brother

136
00:10:35,340 --> 00:10:37,380
on his final journey?

137
00:11:13,500 --> 00:11:18,980
My family's sins
have bound me in chains.

138
00:11:20,100 --> 00:11:25,270
Old wounds from the past still haunt me.

139
00:11:27,150 --> 00:11:32,340
My final meal lies
buried beneath the falling snow.

140
00:11:34,460 --> 00:11:40,550
I gaze at the cold moon
as a lone crow descends.

141
00:11:40,550 --> 00:11:43,620
(Cui Hong's Desolation)

142
00:11:56,310 --> 00:11:59,030
Cui Hong, you formed factions
for personal gain,

143
00:11:59,190 --> 00:12:00,340
framed loyal officials,

144
00:12:00,830 --> 00:12:03,190
orchestrated massacres,
and slaughtered the innocent.

145
00:12:03,670 --> 00:12:07,950
For your unforgivable crimes, you are
hereby sentenced to immediate execution.

146
00:12:29,050 --> 00:12:31,910
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

147
00:12:32,670 --> 00:12:35,610
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

148
00:12:36,270 --> 00:12:39,090
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

149
00:12:39,940 --> 00:12:42,930
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

150
00:12:43,780 --> 00:12:47,100
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

151
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:50,730
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

152
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:57,560
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

153
00:12:58,350 --> 00:13:05,440
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

154
00:13:07,940 --> 00:13:15,790
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

155
00:13:16,090 --> 00:13:17,900
♪I stand here today♪

156
00:13:18,040 --> 00:13:22,550
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

157
00:13:22,550 --> 00:13:30,040
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

158
00:13:30,680 --> 00:13:31,970
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

159
00:13:31,970 --> 00:13:34,370
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

160
00:13:34,810 --> 00:13:41,660
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
